"""
Depth-Aware Trading Bot (ML-Augmented + Spring Trap Architecture)

Requirements:
  - numpy
  - requests
  - scikit-learn
  - joblib

Architecture:
  - Static Zones (the cage): Fixed dollar boundaries, rebuilt only on 3-min out-of-zone or avg shift
  - IQR + Bollinger: Dashboard plotting + ML features (do NOT move zone boundaries)
  - Spring Trap: A numeric feature (0-1) fed to ML. The model learns to avoid tight springs.
  - Volume Shutters: Order book + candle volume feed ML expectations, not zone geometry
  - ML: HistGradientBoostingClassifier (entry) + GradientBoostingRegressor (exit)
  - Kelly Sizing: Dynamic bet sizing capped at +10% / -50%
  - Paused State: Ctrl+C pauses; b/s/r/q commands bypass all filters
"""
